{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted by the realm\u2019s greatest artisans for guardians of legend: Helena, Mara, and Vigour. Three unique armor and weapon cosmetics, one for each associated Hero, and a noble spirit mount that can be ridden by any Hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Supporter Pack is for Fellows who believe in what we\u2019re building and want to see the Fellowship grow stronger and face deadlier threats.<br><br>Your support directly fuels the continued development of the game, future Heroes, more Dungeons, and new updates for all who fight for the Fellowship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return, you\u2019ll receive this exclusive collection of cosmetic treasures which will never be available by any other means!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Guardian\u2019s Supporter Pack includes:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Helena\u2019s Frostsworn Protector Ensemble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079610/extras/a23581833234c9521ac2ba24ca43070e.poster.avif?t=1760630167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079610/extras/a23581833234c9521ac2ba24ca43070e.webm?t=1760630167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079610/extras/a23581833234c9521ac2ba24ca43070e.mp4?t=1760630167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mara\u2019s Timewraith Visage Ensemble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079610/extras/a93a607f5a8712317a25745bef954364.poster.avif?t=1760630167\" 